  "about.descP1": "LDBusiness is a multi-purpose marketplace based in Goma, North Kivu. Unlike traditional platforms, we are not limited to buying and selling. We offer a complete ecosystem that allows sellers to live stream their products, promote their brand through integrated advertising spaces, and manage their store independently.",
